    <div class="summit-prose">
      <span class="summit-eyebrow">01 / Information collected</span>
      <h2>What we collect, and when.</h2>
      <p>When you request an estimate or service, we collect: your name, phone, email, property address, and any details you share about your existing system or the issue. During the estimate visit we collect: envelope measurements (windows, walls, ceilings), duct measurements, photographs of mechanical rooms, and equipment model + serial numbers. The Manual J load calculation we produce contains all of this in structured form.</p>
      <p>The site uses privacy-first analytics (Cloudflare Web Analytics) that don't set cookies and don't fingerprint visitors.</p>

      <span class="summit-eyebrow" style="display:block;margin-top:3rem">02 / Use</span>
      <h2>What we use the data for.</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To produce a Manual J load calculation and itemized proposal.</li>
        <li>To order equipment and pull permits.</li>
        <li>To file IRA 25C tax-credit paperwork on your behalf (with your signed consent).</li>
        <li>To submit Xcel rebate applications on your behalf (with your signed consent).</li>
        <li>To service the equipment under warranty.</li>
        <li>To send a one-time email asking for an honest review (no follow-ups).</li>
      </ul>

      <span class="summit-eyebrow" style="display:block;margin-top:3rem">03 / What we never do</span>
      <h2>Things we don't do with your data.</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Sell it.</li>
        <li>Add you to a marketing list without explicit opt-in.</li>
        <li>Share with manufacturers beyond what's required to register your warranty.</li>
        <li>Run pixel-based remarketing.</li>
      </ul>

      <span class="summit-eyebrow" style="display:block;margin-top:3rem">04 / Third parties we use</span>
      <h2>Equipment manufacturer warranty registration.</h2>
      <p>To activate equipment warranties, we register your install with the manufacturer (Mitsubishi, Carrier, Bosch, Daikin, Trane, etc.). The minimum data required is: your name, address, and the equipment serial number. We do not opt you in to manufacturer marketing communications during registration.</p>
      <p>For IRA tax credit and Xcel rebate filings, the appropriate forms are submitted to those agencies/utilities directly, with your written consent.</p>

      <span class="summit-eyebrow" style="display:block;margin-top:3rem">05 / Retention</span>
      <h2>10 years on equipment records.</h2>
      <p>Install records (load calc, equipment specs, commissioning data) are retained for 10 years to honor warranties. Service-call notes are retained for 5 years. Site analytics are aggregated after 30 days; raw page-view records are deleted.</p>

      <span class="summit-eyebrow" style="display:block;margin-top:3rem">06 / Your rights</span>
      <h2>Request, correct, delete.</h2>
      <p>You can request a copy of any data we hold, ask us to correct it, or ask for deletion (subject to the warranty-related retention windows above). Email <a href="mailto:service@summithvac.example">service@summithvac.example</a> with subject "Privacy request" and we'll reply within 10 business days.</p>

      <span class="summit-eyebrow" style="display:block;margin-top:3rem">07 / Contact</span>
      <h2>Privacy questions.</h2>
      <p>Email <a href="mailto:service@summithvac.example">service@summithvac.example</a> or call <a href="tel:9283159094">(928) 315-9094</a>, ask for Dan.</p>
